ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":7,"title":"A double bed with two pillows","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":8,"title":"A child and a cat searching a bookshelf","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":9,"title":"A bookshelf with a desk","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":10,"title":"Three children looked shocked","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":11,"title":"A cat on the back of a child holding a magnifying glass","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":12,"title":"A child and a cat searching a clothes stand","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":13,"title":"A clothes stand","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":14,"title":"Three children with strange expressions","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":15,"title":"A very angry child","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":16,"title":"A child and a cat looking at a clean room","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":17,"title":"A child and a cat looking at the top of a cupboard","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":18,"title":"A child reaches the top of a cupboard and finds a ball","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"},{"page":19,"title":"Four children and a cat play with a ball","illustrator":"ASM Tanvir Hassan Raju","holder":"Room to Read","year":"2016"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-25"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಶಾಜು, ಮಿಟು, ಇಮೊನ್‌ ಮತ್ತು ಜಮಿ ಆಟವಾಡಲು ಸಜ್ಜಾಗಿದ್ದಾರೆ.","“ಇರಿ, ಇರಿ! ನನ್ನ ಚೆಂಡೂ ತಂದು ಬಿಡುತ್ತೇನೆ,” ಎಂದ ಜಮಿ."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಜಮಿ ರೂಮಿನೊಳಗೆ ಓಡಿದ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅಯ್ಯಯ್ಯೋ !","ಅವನ ರೂಮಲ್ಲಿ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಚೆಲ್ಲಾಪಿಲ್ಲಿ!"]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p04.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಜಮಿ ಈಗ ಯಾವ ಮೂಲೆಯಿಂದ ಚೆಂಡು ಹುಡುಕಲು ಶುರು ಮಾಡುವುದಪ್ಪ?"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಚೆಂಡೇನಾದರೂ ಹಾಸಿಗೆ ಮೇಲಿದೆಯಾ?"]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲ,","ಅದು ಅಲ್ಲಿಲ್ಲ!"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಚೆಂಡು ಡೆಸ್ಕ್‌ನಲ್ಲಿದೆಯಾ?"]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲ, ಅದು ಅಲ್ಲೂ ಇಲ್ಲ!"]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಜಮಿ, ಬೇಗ ಬಾ!” ಶಾಜು ಕರೆದ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಜಮಿ ರೂಮಿನಿಂದ ಕೂಗಿ ಹೇಳಿದ,","“ಇರಿ! ನನ್ನ ಚೆಂಡು ಎಲ್ಲೋ ಸಿಗುತಿಲ್ಲ!”"]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಅದೇನಾದರೂ ಈ ಬಟ್ಟೆಗಳ ಒಣ ಹಾಕುವಲ್ಲಿ ಇರಬಹುದೇ?","ಇಲ್ಲವೇ ಈ ಬಟ್ಟೆಗಳ ಕೆಳಗೆ?"]},{"n":12,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p12.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ಇಲ್ಲ!","ಚೆಂಡೂ ಇಲ್ಲೂ ಇಲ್ಲ!"]},{"n":13,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p13.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["“ಅಬ್ಬಬ್ಬ, ಕಾದು, ಕಾದು ಸಾಕಾಯಿತು! ಜಮಿ, ನಾವು ಹೊರಟೆವು!”","ಶಾಜು, ಮಿಟು ಮತ್ತು ಇಮೊನ್‌ ಕಿರುಚಿದರು."]},{"n":14,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p14.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":[]},{"n":15,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p15.jpg","width":639,"height":689},"text":["ಜಮಿಗೆ ಅವನ ಮೇಲೆಯೇ ಕೋಪ ಬಂತು.","ಚೆಂಡು ಎಲ್ಲೆಂದರೆ ಎಲ್ಲೂ ಸಿಗಲಿಲ್ಲ!","ಆದರೆ, ಅವನ ರೂಮಂತೂ ಅಚ್ಚುಕಟ್ಟಾಯಿತು…"]},{"n":16,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p16.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["…ಆದರೆ ಆ ಡಬ್ಬಿಯೊಂದನ್ನು ಬಿಟ್ಟು,","ಅದೇ ಆ ಕಪಾಟಿನ ಮೇಲಿದೆಯಲ್ಲ…"]},{"n":17,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p17.jpg","width":708,"height":508},"text":["ನೋಡು!","ಇಲ್ಲಿದೆ ಚೆಂಡು!"]},{"n":18,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/586829-chendu-ellide/p18.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಮಾರನೇ ದಿನ, ಜಮಿ ತನ್ನ ಗೆಳೆಯರನ್ನೆಲ್ಲಾ ಕರೆದ. ಈ ಸಲ ಚೆಂಡು ಆಟದ ಸಮಯಕ್ಕೆ ಸರಿಯಾಗಿ ಸಿಕ್ಕಿತು!"]}],"wordCount":121}